==Serbo-Croatian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/rǎːditi/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|ра|ди|ти|lang=sh}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}}. Cognate with Bulgarian {{term|радея||care for|lang=bg}}, Russian {{term|радеть||care for|lang=ru}}. Non-Slavic cognates include Ossetian {{term|рад||order|lang=os}}, Sanskrit {{term|राध्यते||tr=rāhyate|lang=sa}}, {{term|राधति||tr=rādhati|lang=sa}} and {{term|राध्नोति||tr=rādhnoti|succeed|lang=sa}}, Gothic {{term|𐌲𐌰𐍂𐌴𐌳𐌰𐌽|tr=garedan|lang=got}}.

